{"id":165431,"title":"Global Transport for Fluid Reconstruction with Learned Self-Supervision","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/cvpr46437.2021.00168","final_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2104.06031","year":2021,"kind":"paper","source":"openalex","doi":"10.1109/cvpr46437.2021.00168","arxiv":"2104.06031","sha256":"13c2fe160fb601b10650df595d46389128e390971f229c141c9c7bc9d55f3bf1","ctype":"application/pdf","text_src":"oa","fetched_at":1793376518.9529295,"text_chars":78941,"abstract":"We propose a novel method to reconstruct volumetric flows from sparse views via a global transport formulation. Instead of obtaining the space-time function of the observations, we reconstruct its motion based on a single initial state. In addition we introduce a learned self-supervision that constrains observations from unseen angles. These visual constraints are coupled via the transport constraints and a differentiable rendering step to arrive at a robust end-to-end reconstruction algorithm. This makes the reconstruction of highly realistic flow motions possible, even from only a single input view. We show with a variety of synthetic and real flows that the proposed global reconstruction of the transport process yields an improved reconstruction of the fluid motion.","file":null,"marks":[],"links":["https://arxiv.org/pdf/2104.06031","https://doi.org/10.1109/cvpr46437.2021.00168"],"cited_by":[{"path":"3280-polynomial-root-finding-compact-kernel.md","name":"Polynomial Root Finding (Compact Kernel)","k":4},{"path":"3280-gradient-descent-solver.md","name":"Gradient Descent Solver","k":4},{"path":"2788-ray-marching-and-discretization.md","name":"Ray Marching and Discretization","k":17},{"path":"7213-smoothed-2d-supervision.md","name":"Smoothed 2D Supervision","k":5},{"path":"7695-discriminator-loss-with-gradient-penalty.md","name":"Discriminator Loss with Gradient Penalty","k":2},{"path":"4622-coupled-density-and-velocity-estimation.md","name":"Coupled Density and Velocity Estimation","k":3},{"path":"10202-gradient-computation-and-back-propagation.md","name":"Gradient Computation and Back-Propagation","k":10},{"path":"4380-uniform-grid-boundary-checks.md","name":"Uniform Grid Boundary Checks","k":4},{"path":"10312-progressive-gan-discriminator.md","name":"Progressive GAN Discriminator","k":2},{"path":"16691-discriminator-and-decoder.md","name":"Discriminator and Decoder","k":2},{"path":"21644-fully-convolutional-discriminator.md","name":"Fully Convolutional Discriminator","k":1},{"path":"18359-parameter-and-optimizer-update.md","name":"Parameter and Optimizer Update","k":2},{"path":"20592-global-transport-formulation.md","name":"Global Transport Formulation","k":1},{"path":"20619-visual-hull-construction.md","name":"Visual Hull Construction","k":2},{"path":"20606-differentiable-advection-gradients.md","name":"Differentiable Advection Gradients","k":1},{"path":"20373-temporal-depth-upsampling.md","name":"Temporal Depth Upsampling","k":2},{"path":"20753-coupled-optimization.md","name":"Coupled Optimization","k":1},{"path":"18610-differentiable-volumetric-rendering.md","name":"Differentiable Volumetric Rendering","k":2},{"path":"21686-fixed-background-color.md","name":"Fixed Background Color","k":2},{"path":"22942-regularization-and-constraints.md","name":"Regularization and Constraints","k":2},{"path":"20694-physical-prior-transport-losses.md","name":"Physical Prior / Transport Losses","k":1}]}